Output demo.gif
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set FontSize 16

Hide
Type "go build -o cmd/wurl ."
Enter
Sleep 2
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 1

Show
Type "./cmd/wurl -file burgershop.openapi.yaml"
Sleep 1
Enter

Sleep 5
Down@500ms 3
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 5
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms

Sleep 3
Ctrl+C
Enter
Sleep 5

Hide
Type "rm -r cmd"
Enter
